		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Slender-bodied, three- headed dragon. A cross between a giant winged serpent and a hydra. Glutton that plunders entire regions.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 48, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 bite +6 (2d8) or 1 fire breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Fire Breath</strong>. Fills a double near-sized cube extending from dragon. DEX 15+ or 5d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Fireblood</strong>. Fire immune.</p><p></p><p><strong>Regenerate</strong>. Regains 2d6 HP on its turn unless its wounds are cauterized with acid.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
